&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;（単位：千t-CO&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;₂&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
